OL,5,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,6,     FIn a sports store, a woman
OL,7,     Fprotests that she's paid for all
OL,8,     Fher items, but her receipts tell a
OL,9,     Fdifferent story. Plus undercover
OL,10,     Fdetective Steve monitors pick
OL,11,     Fpocketing in China Town. (Ep16)
