OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FAt Bradford's Ridge Medical
OL,7,     FPractice, baby Imaan is suffering
OL,8,     Fsevere nappy rash, Aris has been
OL,9,     Fleaking yellow fluid from a cyst
OL,10,     Fin his armpit, and Gemma has a
OL,11,     Fworrying tongue ulcer.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
