OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Adil Sheraz helps a patient
OL,7,     Fwho's been quoted #4500 elsewhere
OL,8,     Fto remove his five head cysts. Dr
OL,9,     FEmma McMullen turns detective to
OL,10,     Fget to the bottom of a mystery
OL,11,     Fskin condition.
OL,12,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FFive years after the unexpected
OL,14,     Fdeath of his girlfriend in 2006,
OL,15,     FRobert Trigg calls 999 to report
OL,16,     Fanother unexplained death - that
OL,17,     Fof his new girlfriend.
